Dear Sunho,

Thank you for your inquiry. My name is Chris Bailey and I manage the 
Converter section of our Company. I have a range of Industrial style LCD 
panels that accept CGA and EGA signal timings for display at VGA up to XGA 
resolutions. The links for the 15 inch and 12.1 inch panels are posted 
below:

ID#472 - 15 inch:     
http://www.converters.tv/products/vga_to_vga/472.html

ID#492 - 12.1 inch:   
http://www.converters.tv/products/vga_to_vga/492.html

We also have 8.4, 10.4. 17 and 19 inch models available.

I also have a new converter PCB Board that accepts CGA, EGA, HD Component 
and VGA input for output at VGA+ resolutions. This board allows you to use 
any Commercial CRT, LCD or Plasma panel with your source video signal. I 
will have this board available for general sale next week. The following 
link will give you features and specifications:

ID#657:    http://www.converters.tv/products/vga_to_vga/657.html

Please review the links posted above and if you have any questions, then 
please feel free to contact back to me at any time. I will assist you in 
any way that I can. 

Best Regards,
Chris Bailey.
Manager
